{
  "title": "MIDI Out",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Sends this slot's",
        "MIDI out of the",
        "USB-A port, to an",
        "external synth or",
        "any class-compliant",
        "MIDI device.",
        "",
        "Put it after other",
        "MIDI FX: what Chord",
        "or Arp produce is",
        "what goes out.",
        "",
        "Everything also",
        "passes on down the",
        "chain unchanged, so",
        "a synth after it",
        "still plays. Leave",
        "the synth empty to",
        "play only the",
        "external one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Channel",
      "lines": [
        "Knob 1: MIDI Channel",
        " 1 to 16",
        "",
        "Every note, CC, bend",
        "and aftertouch goes",
        "out on this channel,",
        "whatever channel it",
        "came in on.",
        "",
        "Change it while",
        "holding notes and",
        "they still release",
        "on the channel they",
        "started on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Clock is not sent -",
        "turn on Move's own",
        "MIDI Clock Out for",
        "tempo sync.",
        "",
        "Move's tracks can",
        "send MIDI out of",
        "USB-A too. Pick a",
        "channel they do not",
        "use, or the synth",
        "hears both.",
        "",
        "Leave the slot's",
        "MIDI FX setting on",
        "Schw. Schw+Move",
        "also sends notes to",
        "Move, which echoes",
        "them to USB-A, so",
        "they double.",
        "",
        "If the external",
        "synth echoes MIDI",
        "back in, turn its",
        "MIDI thru off."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
